trait-category-avali = Augments

trait-stasis-name = Deployable Cryostasis
trait-stasis-desc = You have subdermal implants within your wings designed to help weather the worst in violent encounters. These augments allow you to enter a state of suspended animation for rapid, albeit immobile, regeneration of most physical trauma.

trait-nanites-name = "Guardian" Nanite System
trait-nanites-desc = A unique augment connected to your heart serves as a factory for nanomachines that flow through your bloodstream. These nanites are designed for general medical purposes, providing mild healing against most light injuries and toxins.

trait-avalijump-name = Servo-Assisted Motion
trait-avalijump-desc = You have a complex network of cybernetics, servos, or other augmentations centered on your legs, granting you greater mobility and the ability to leap a short distance. However, the increased energy takes a toll on your metabolism.